                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e82bb676-9c86-439f-9ba8-3b435bd49a5a",
                                "sense_id": "fd49aca9-f774-3e5e-aece-94920cb7e894",
                                "text": "Ру́сскую погово́рку «и швец, и жнец, и на дуде́ игре́ц» воплоти́ли в Япо́нии, разрабо́тав моде́ль ро́бота-разнорабо́чего, спосо́бного выполня́ть разли́чные тяжёлые рабо́ты.",
                                "translation": "The Russian proverb \"the tailor, the reaper, and the fife player\" (i.e. jack of all trades) was realized in Japan, where a model of robot-handyman was developed capable of performing various hard labor.",
                                "english": "The Russian proverb \"the tailor, the reaper, and the fife player\" (i.e. jack of all trades) was realized in Japan, where a model of robot-handyman was developed capable of performing various hard labor."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
